  "uid": "hyperliquid-p2p-traffic",
  "title": "Hyperliquid P2P Traffic",
  "description": "Observed inbound and outbound TCP payload by peer IP, with range volumes and collector coverage. Requires Linux and --per-peer-metrics.",
